{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S04、S08—S09、S13—S14压缩了一些关键心理因果，尤其是想留住当下、担心未来失去、想收回喜欢却又做不到之间的转折，不如X交代得完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词让人更快抓住每段人物状态，感受部分又有具体的音色、力度、节奏、身体触感，并且能随音乐出现，听觉与情绪的对应更细腻。X的优势是人物心理的因果交代更充分，前后选择的来由更容易理解，故事线也更完整。综合作为边听音乐边扫屏幕的普通观众，我更愿意选Y，但它值得保留X那种把人物为什么犹豫、为什么改变交代清楚的能力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "422854b4-fcf8-41ae-a6ce-601f9a76b98a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T224823405517Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:49:11.375806+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ba6e462386bd85026b2da770933483c669233199f1d6131b2f30c022f0cbe010", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp